#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:5
msgid "Members management"
msgstr "Upravljanje članovima"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:7
msgid "One of the first contact with Galette interface after the installation, login and dashboard will be members list, main part of the system. Of course, this list will be empty for now :)"
msgstr ""
"Nakon instalacije, prijave i pregleda nadzorne ploče jedno od prvih mjesta s "
"kojima ćete se susresti jest popis članova, glavni dio Galettea. Zasad će, "
"naravno, biti prazan :)"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:9
msgid "Let's start by creating a new member. As everywhere in Galette, mandatory fields are displayed with a red border; all other are optional. Different parts of the page (`Identity`, `Contact information`, `Galette related data` and maybe `Dynamic fields`) can be retracted clicking on their respective title."
msgstr ""
"Započnimo dodavanjem člana. Kao i drugdje u Galetteu, obvezna su polja "
"označena crvenim obrubom, a ostala nisu obvezna. Odjeljke stranice "
"(`Identitet`, `Podaci za kontakt`, `Podaci u Galetteu` i eventualno "
"`Dinamička polja`) možete sažeti klikom na njihove naslove."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:11
msgid "`Identity` screen part adding member"
msgstr "Odjeljak `Identitet` pri dodavanju člana"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:16
msgid "`Identity` screen part editing member"
msgstr "Odjeljak `Identitet` pri uređivanju člana"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:21
msgid "On date fields, you can access a calendar:"
msgstr "U poljima za datum možete otvoriti kalendar:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:23
msgid "Date selection"
msgstr "Odabir datuma"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:27
msgid "When storing a member (or any other object in Galette), page will be reloaded with all information you've entered (excepting passwords)."
msgstr ""
"Nakon spremanja člana ili drugog zapisa u Galetteu stranica se ponovno "
"učitava sa svim unesenim podacima osim lozinki."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:30
msgid "Picture"
msgstr "Fotografija"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:32
msgid "A picture can be added to each member card, in JPEG, PNG, GIF or WebP format. When **Force member picture ratio** is checked in the :ref:`preferences <man_preferences>`, pictures are resized and cropped to the chosen ratio; the **Cropping focus** option of the form tells which part of the picture to keep."
msgstr ""
"Svakom članskom kartonu možete dodati fotografiju u formatu JPEG, PNG, GIF "
"ili WebP. Ako je u :ref:`postavkama <man_preferences>` uključeno **Nametni "
"omjer stranica fotografije člana**, fotografije se smanjuju i obrezuju na "
"odabrani omjer. Opcija **Žarište obrezivanja** u obrascu određuje koji dio "
"fotografije treba zadržati."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:35
msgid "Duplicate, remove"
msgstr "Udvostručavanje i brisanje"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:37
msgid "From a member card, **Duplicate** opens the form of a new member, filled in with the information of the current one; useful for members of a same family or a same company."
msgstr ""
"Gumb **Udvostruči** na članskom kartonu otvara obrazac za novog člana s "
"podacima trenutačnog člana. To je korisno za članove iste obitelji ili "
"tvrtke."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:39
msgid "Members can be removed one by one from the actions of the list, or several at once from the **For the selection:** menu."
msgstr ""
"Članove možete brisati pojedinačno putem radnji u popisu ili više njih "
"odjednom putem izbornika **Za odabrane:**."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:43
msgid "Removing a member also removes their picture, contributions, transactions, reminders and dynamic fields values, and removes them from their groups. This cannot be undone. To keep the history of your association, you may rather set the account as inactive."
msgstr ""
"Brisanjem člana brišu se i njegova fotografija, uplate, transakcije, "
"podsjetnici i vrijednosti dinamičkih polja te se uklanja iz grupa. Brisanje "
"nije moguće poništiti. Ako želite sačuvati povijest udruge, možete umjesto "
"toga označiti račun kao neaktivan."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:46
msgid "Members list"
msgstr "Popis članova"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:48
msgid "Members list allows you to:"
msgstr "Popis članova omogućuje vam:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:50
msgid "filter and order members,"
msgstr "filtriranje i razvrstavanje članova,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:51
msgid "display members card,"
msgstr "prikaz članskih kartona,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:52
msgid "removals,"
msgstr "brisanje,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:53
msgid "send mailings,"
msgstr "slanje skupnih poruka,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:54
msgid "generate PDF labels,"
msgstr "izradu adresnih naljepnica u PDF-u,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:55
msgid "generate PDF attendance sheets,"
msgstr "izradu evidencija prisutnosti u PDF-u,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:56
msgid "generate PDF members cards,"
msgstr "izradu članskih iskaznica u PDF-u,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:57
msgid "CSV exports,"
msgstr "izvoz u CSV,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:58
msgid "mass changes."
msgstr "skupne izmjene."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:60
msgid "Each possible action per member is grouped at the end of the line, actions designed to be applied on a selection are in the **For the selection:** menu above the list. Plugins may add entries in both cases."
msgstr ""
"Radnje za pojedinog člana nalaze se na kraju retka, a radnje za odabrane "
"članove u izborniku **Za odabrane:** iznad popisa. Dodaci mogu dodati stavke "
"na oba mjesta."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:63
msgid "Filter and select members"
msgstr "Filtriranje i odabir članova"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:65
msgid "Filtering members list is documented in :ref:`search section <search_galette>`. All possibilities can be used with actions on selection."
msgstr ""
"Filtriranje popisa članova opisano je u :ref:`odjeljku o pretraživanju "
"<search_galette>`. Sve mogućnosti filtriranja mogu se kombinirati s radnjama "
"nad odabranim članovima."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:70
msgid "Mass changes"
msgstr "Skupne izmjene"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:74
msgid "Members selected in list can be edited (partially) at once."
msgstr "Odabrane članove možete djelomično urediti sve odjednom."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:76
msgid "Mass change selected members"
msgstr "Skupna izmjena odabranih članova"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:81
msgid "Only fields with a checked checkbox at the beginning of the line will be changed. A summary will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Promijenit će se samo polja čiji je potvrdni okvir na početku retka označen. "
"Prikazat će se sažetak izmjena."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:83
msgid "Summary of changes"
msgstr "Sažetak izmjena"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:89
msgid "Ordering"
msgstr "Razvrstavanje"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:90
msgid "It is possible to order members list on following fields:"
msgstr "Popis članova možete razvrstati prema sljedećim poljima:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:92
msgid "name,"
msgstr "imenu i prezimenu,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:93
msgid "nickname,"
msgstr "nadimku,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:94
msgid "status,"
msgstr "statusu,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:95
msgid "contribution status,"
msgstr "statusu članarine,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:96
msgid "modification date."
msgstr "datumu izmjene."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:98
msgid "In the list, a green icon identifies **sponsors**: the members who made a donation during the current period. The **Show legend** link explains all the icons of the list."
msgstr ""
"Zelena ikona u popisu označava **donatore**, odnosno članove koji su "
"donirali u tekućem razdoblju. Poveznica **Prikaži legendu** objašnjava sve "
"ikone u popisu."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:100
msgid "Most of the times, the result is transparent. Just note ordering on `status` will use status priority and ordering on `contribution status` will use creation date, contribution exemption and due date;"
msgstr ""
"Razvrstavanje uglavnom daje očekivani rezultat. Imajte na umu da se za "
"`status` koristi prioritet statusa, a za `status članarine` datum unosa, "
"oslobođenje od članarine i datum isteka članstva;"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:105
msgid "Configure CSV fields"
msgstr "Podešavanje polja za CSV"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:107
msgid "Per default, CSV export for a members selection will provide same fields as the ones that are displayed on screen. It is possible to change this behavior by specifying yourself which fields must be exported in the ``galette/config/local_export_fields.inc.php`` file. If for example you only want identifier, first and last member names, the content of the file will be:"
msgstr ""
"Pri izvozu odabranih članova u CSV zadano se izvoze polja prikazana na "
"zaslonu. To možete promijeniti navođenjem željenih polja u datoteci "
"``galette/config/local_export_fields.inc.php``. Ako, primjerice, želite samo "
"identifikator, ime i prezime člana, sadržaj datoteke bit će:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:119
msgid "E-Mailing"
msgstr "Slanje e-pošte"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:121
msgid "**Mailings in Galette are designed to work from the members list.**"
msgstr "**Skupne poruke u Galetteu namijenjene su slanju iz popisa članova.**"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:123
msgid "Direct mailing creation will work without problems, but members selection is harder."
msgstr ""
"Skupnu poruku možete izraditi i izravno, ali tada je odabir članova "
"složeniji."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:125
msgid "From Galette, you can send mailings to a selection of members. Each sent mailing is stored in order to be reused, so you can select a stored mailing to be used as a template, retrieving selected members list, mailing subject and contents."
msgstr ""
"Iz Galettea možete slati skupne poruke odabranim članovima. Svaka poslana "
"poruka pohranjuje se za ponovnu uporabu. Pohranjenu poruku možete odabrati "
"kao predložak i preuzeti njezin popis primatelja, predmet i sadržaj."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:127
msgid "To send a new mailing, select members from the list and then choose **Mail** in the **For the selection:** menu above the list. If some of selected members does not have an email address, Galette will propose you to print corresponding labels."
msgstr ""
"Za slanje nove skupne poruke odaberite članove s popisa pa **E-pošta** u "
"izborniku **Za odabrane:** iznad popisa. Ako neki od njih nemaju adresu e-"
"pošte, Galette će ponuditi ispis adresnih naljepnica za njih."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:129
msgid "Selected members for mailing"
msgstr "Članovi odabrani za slanje skupne poruke"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:134
msgid "Selecting members in the list must be done on one page only. Filtering features, as well as the possibility to display all members will be useful ;)"
msgstr ""
"Članove morate odabrati na jednoj stranici popisa. Pri tome pomažu "
"filtriranje i mogućnost prikaza svih članova ;)"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:138
msgid "You can choose a sender for each mailing:"
msgstr "Za svaku skupnu poruku možete odabrati pošiljatelja:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:140
msgid "**from Galette preferences** (default value): this will use information stored in preferences,"
msgstr ""
"**iz postavki Galettea** (zadano): koriste se podaci pohranjeni u postavkama,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:141
msgid "**current logged-in user**: will use the name and the email of the current logged-in user (not available for super admin),"
msgstr ""
"**trenutačno prijavljeni korisnik**: koriste se ime i adresa e-pošte "
"prijavljenog korisnika (nije dostupno glavnom administratoru),"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:142
msgid "**other**: you can set any name and email address you want."
msgstr "**drugo**: možete unijeti željeno ime i adresu e-pošte."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:144
msgid "Sender selection"
msgstr "Odabir pošiljatelja"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:149
msgid "Once the subject has been filled, you can work on the contents. You can send email in text only, or in HTML (keep in mind sending HTML messages by mail is often not the way to go). A simple HTML WYSIWYG editor is provided."
msgstr ""
"Nakon unosa predmeta možete sastaviti sadržaj. Poruke možete slati kao "
"običan tekst ili HTML. Imajte na umu da HTML često nije najbolji izbor za e-"
"poštu. Dostupan je jednostavan vizualni uređivač HTML-a."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:151
msgid "Once the HTML editor is enabled, the checkbox to handle HTML tags is automatically checked, remember to check the box if you do not use the editor but want to send HTML!"
msgstr ""
"Kad uključite HTML uređivač, automatski se označava okvir za obradu HTML "
"oznaka. Ako šaljete HTML bez tog uređivača, označite okvir ručno!"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:153
msgid "Even if Galette is able to send HTML emails, this is discouraged. Messages length will be way larger (for almost nothing), and some (like me!) read their emails as text only. That is why Galette will **always** provide a text version of HTML emails."
msgstr ""
"Iako Galette podržava HTML poruke, njihova se uporaba ne preporučuje. Poruke "
"su znatno veće bez mnogo koristi, a neki korisnici (poput mene!) čitaju samo "
"običan tekst. Zato Galette **uvijek** uključuje i tekstnu verziju HTML "
"poruke."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:155
msgid "It is also possible to add attachements, just click on the `Browse` button in that attachements section. If your browser is compatible, you can add several files at once (using `Shift` and `Ctrl` keys). All attachements are stored on disk, under a directory named with the mailing identifier (automatically defined from database)."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati i privitke klikom na gumb `Pregledaj` u odjeljku za privitke. "
"Ako preglednik to podržava, možete odabrati više datoteka odjednom tipkama "
"`Shift` i `Ctrl`. Privici se pohranjuju na disk u mapu nazvanu prema "
"identifikatoru skupne poruke, koji se automatski određuje iz baze podataka."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:158
msgid "Each attachment has a maximum size of its own, which you can :ref:`change from the advanced configuration <upload_sizes>` page."
msgstr ""
"Svaki privitak ima vlastito ograničenje veličine koje možete "
":ref:`promijeniti u naprednim postavkama <upload_sizes>`."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:160
msgid "`Preview` button let you preview your message before sending it."
msgstr "Gumb `Pregled` omogućuje pregled poruke prije slanja."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:162
msgid "Preview message"
msgstr "Pregled poruke"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:167
msgid "Any started emailings will be stored in your session to be retrieved in the future. An icon will be displayed in pages titles when a mailing is progress and will provide a link to go to it."
msgstr ""
"Započete skupne poruke čuvaju se u vašoj sesiji kako biste im se mogli "
"vratiti. Dok je poruka u pripremi, u naslovima stranica pojavljuje se ikona "
"s poveznicom na nju."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:169
msgid "If you want, you can cancel this mailing using the `Cancel mailing` button, it will be deleted from your session. If you want to store it for a longer time, you can add the `Save` button. It will then be stored in the mailings list, and you will be able to grab it later."
msgstr ""
"Poruku možete odbaciti gumbom `Odustani od skupne poruke`, čime se briše iz "
"sesije. Za dulje čuvanje upotrijebite gumb `Spremi`. Poruka će se tada "
"pohraniti u popis skupnih poruka i moći ćete joj pristupiti poslije."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:174
msgid "Sending large mailings"
msgstr "Slanje velikih skupnih poruka"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:178
msgid "By default, a mailing is a single message, sent right away, carrying every recipient in blind copy - but mail servers restrict what one message may carry, and how fast you may send."
msgstr ""
"Zadano se skupna poruka odmah šalje kao jedna poruka sa svim primateljima u "
"skrivenoj kopiji. Poslužitelji e-pošte, međutim, ograničavaju broj "
"primatelja u poruci i brzinu slanja."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:182
msgid "Using your \"personal\" SMTP provider is often not a good idea; dedicated services are better suited for large mailings."
msgstr ""
"Uporaba osobnog SMTP računa često nije dobar izbor; namjenske usluge "
"prikladnije su za slanje velikih skupnih poruka."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:184
msgid "And you even may have limits on a dedicated service."
msgstr "Ograničenja mogu postojati i na namjenskoj usluzi."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:186
msgid "Galette :ref:`sending limits <mail_throttling>` changes what happens once you confirm the sending:"
msgstr ""
"Galetteova :ref:`ograničenja slanja <mail_throttling>` mijenjaju postupak "
"nakon što potvrdite slanje:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:188
msgid "with a **batch size** set, Galette splits the recipients into several messages of at most that size, and waits the configured delay between two of them. Sending stays synchronous: the confirmation comes once everything has left,"
msgstr ""
"ako je zadana **veličina skupine**, Galette dijeli primatelje u poruke s "
"najviše toliko primatelja i čeka zadani interval između poruka. Slanje je i "
"dalje sinkrono: potvrda se prikazuje tek kad su sve poruke poslane,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:189
msgid "with an **hourly or daily limit** set, sending cannot be done in one go any more. Galette stores the mailing, queues one entry per recipient, and takes you to a progress page."
msgstr ""
"ako je zadano **satno ili dnevno ograničenje**, slanje se više ne može "
"izvršiti odjednom. Galette pohranjuje skupnu poruku, dodaje zasebnu stavku "
"za svakog primatelja u red za slanje i otvara stranicu napretka."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:191
msgid "The progress page sends the mailing batch after batch and shows how far it is: recipients sent, remaining and failed, and what the quota has consumed so far. Leave it open until it announces the mailing has been sent."
msgstr ""
"Stranica napretka šalje poruku u skupinama i prikazuje broj obrađenih, "
"preostalih i neuspjelih primatelja te iskorištenost kvote. Ostavite je "
"otvorenu dok ne potvrdi da je skupna poruka poslana."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:193
msgid "A mailing being sent, halfway through its queue"
msgstr "Slanje skupne poruke na polovici reda za slanje"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:198
msgid "Nothing is lost if you close it, or if the quota runs out before the end: the queue is stored in database. The page then tells you sending will resume later, and the remaining recipients go out either when you open the mailing again, or from a :ref:`drainer running outside the browser <mailing_queue_cron>`."
msgstr ""
"Ništa se ne gubi ako zatvorite stranicu ili se kvota potroši prije "
"završetka: red se čuva u bazi podataka. Stranica tada javlja da će se slanje "
"nastaviti poslije. Preostale poruke šalju se kad ponovno otvorite skupnu "
"poruku ili putem :ref:`obrade reda izvan preglednika <mailing_queue_cron>`."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:202
msgid "The progress page is the only thing a queued mailing *needs*. Galette proposes alternative methods to :ref:`drain the mail queue <mailing_queue_cron>` we really recommends ;-)"
msgstr ""
"Stranica napretka jedino je što skupna poruka u redu za slanje *zahtijeva*. "
"Galette nudi i druge načine :ref:`obrade reda za slanje <mailing_queue_cron>"
"`, koje svakako preporučujemo ;-)"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:204
msgid "A queued mailing is stored in the history right away, and only counts as **sent** once its last recipient has left the queue."
msgstr ""
"Skupna poruka u redu za slanje odmah se pohranjuje u povijest, a status "
"**poslano** dobiva tek kad posljednji primatelj napusti red."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:207
msgid "Mailings history"
msgstr "Povijest skupnih poruka"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:209
msgid "When you start a mailing, it is stored into your session. Session ends when users log out, or on a server defined timeout. Mailing history stores the mailing in the database, this ensure it will always be available in the future."
msgstr ""
"Kad započnete skupnu poruku, ona se čuva u sesiji. Sesija završava odjavom "
"ili nakon isteka vremena zadanog na poslužitelju. Povijest skupnih poruka "
"čuva poruke u bazi podataka, pa ostaju dostupne i poslije."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:211
msgid "Every sent mailing is stored into the database, and can be used as a template to write a new one. In this case, a new mailing will be created using information from the history, and the original one will be kept as is."
msgstr ""
"Svaka poslana skupna poruka pohranjuje se u bazu i može poslužiti kao "
"predložak za novu. Tada se iz podataka u povijesti izrađuje nova poruka, a "
"izvorna ostaje nepromijenjena."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:213
msgid "Mailings can be stored before they are sent. In this case, it is possible to continue it later. When you use history on a draft mailing, original entry will be replaced on sending."
msgstr ""
"Skupne poruke možete spremiti i prije slanja te nastaviti rad poslije. Ako "
"nastavite nacrt iz povijesti, izvorni se zapis zamjenjuje pri slanju."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:215
msgid "When you use an existing history entry, here are the information that will be used:"
msgstr "Pri ponovnoj uporabi zapisa iz povijesti preuzimaju se:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:217
msgid "recipients,"
msgstr "primatelji,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:218
msgid "attachements,"
msgstr "privici,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:219
msgid "subject,"
msgstr "predmet,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:220
msgid "message,"
msgstr "poruka,"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:221
msgid "html/text flag."
msgstr "oznaka HTML-a ili običnog teksta."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:226
msgid "CSV imports"
msgstr "Uvoz CSV-a"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:228
msgid "It is possible to import member data from a predefined model. A default model is provided, but you can configure it to suits your needs, using the `Imports` menu entry."
msgstr ""
"Podatke o članovima možete uvesti prema unaprijed definiranom predlošku. "
"Dostupan je zadani predložak, a možete ga prilagoditi putem stavke izbornika "
"`Uvoz`."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:231
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:233
msgid "Import model defines fields and their order in a CSV file. When importing, current model will be used to check your CSV file integrity."
msgstr ""
"Predložak uvoza određuje polja i njihov redoslijed u CSV datoteci. Pri uvozu "
"trenutačni se predložak koristi za provjeru ispravnosti datoteke."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:235
msgid "To configure the model, click on the `Configure` button from the UI."
msgstr "Za podešavanje predloška kliknite gumb `Podesi` u sučelju."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:237
msgid "Default import model"
msgstr "Zadani predložak uvoza"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:242
msgid "If proposed model is not ok for you, click on `Edit model` and choose your fields:"
msgstr ""
"Ako vam ponuđeni predložak ne odgovara, kliknite `Uredi predložak` i "
"odaberite polja:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:244
msgid "Import model configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanje predloška uvoza"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:249
msgid "Once you have selected your fields, click on the `Store new model` button."
msgstr "Nakon odabira polja kliknite `Spremi novi predložak`."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:251
msgid "Dynamic fields of the members can be imported as well, except file fields. A :ref:`repeatable field <dynamic_fields_repeat>` gets one column per value; a field with no limit gets 10 columns."
msgstr ""
"Mogu se uvoziti i dinamička polja članova, osim polja za datoteke. "
":ref:`Ponovljivo polje <dynamic_fields_repeat>` dobiva jedan stupac po "
"vrijednosti; polje bez ograničenja dobiva 10 stupaca."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:253
msgid "When in the current model tab, you can download an empty model from the `Generate an empty CSV file` button. Of course, you can change model if you want, or remove it to get the default model back."
msgstr ""
"Na kartici trenutačnog predloška možete preuzeti prazni predložak gumbom "
"`Izradi praznu CSV datoteku`. Predložak možete promijeniti ili ukloniti kako "
"biste vratili zadani."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:256
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Uvoz"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:258
msgid "Once you have retrieved and fill the empty file, you have to send it using the form `Send a new file`. At this step, Galette will check your file extension is ``csv`` (or ``txt``) and its size does not exceed the :ref:`maximum size allowed for imports <upload_sizes>` (2 Mo by default)."
msgstr ""
"Kad preuzmete i ispunite praznu datoteku, učitajte je putem obrasca `Pošalji "
"novu datoteku`. Galette provjerava ima li nastavak ``csv`` ili ``txt`` te "
"prelazi li :ref:`najveću dopuštenu veličinu za uvoz <upload_sizes>` (zadano "
"2 MB)."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:262
msgid "If you want to import a huge file, you can put it from your FTP client in the ``galette/data/imports`` directory, or split it into several smaller files you can import one by one."
msgstr ""
"Veliku datoteku možete FTP klijentom staviti u mapu ``galette/data/imports`` "
"ili je podijeliti u manje datoteke koje uvozite pojedinačno."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:264
msgid "Sent files are listed in the `Existing files` section. You can show, remove or import it:"
msgstr ""
"Poslane datoteke prikazuju se u odjeljku `Postojeće datoteke`. Možete ih "
"pregledati, ukloniti ili uvesti:"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:266
msgid "Select and import file"
msgstr "Odabir i uvoz datoteke"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:271
msgid "The `dry run` checkbox (checked per default) is designed to test your file data are valid (mandatory fields filled, data formatting is correct, ...) without storing anything in the database."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdni okvir `Probni uvoz`, koji je zadano označen, omogućuje provjeru "
"ispravnosti podataka (obveznih polja, formata i slično) bez spremanja u bazu."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:273
msgid "When you import a CSV file, if one line is incorrect, previous ones may be stored in the database already; so it is advised to use the dry-run before to get error fixed."
msgstr ""
"Ako je neki redak CSV datoteke neispravan, prethodni retci možda su već "
"spremljeni u bazu. Zato se preporučuje najprije izvršiti probni uvoz i "
"ispraviti pogreške."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:275
msgid "Galette displays error messages if something went wrong, in dry-run mode or not."
msgstr ""
"Galette prikazuje poruke o pogreškama neovisno o tome radi li se o probnom "
"ili stvarnom uvozu."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:279
msgid "You may see mandatory missing fields even if import is ok. This may happen when all the fields you set as required in Galette configuration are not listed in your import model."
msgstr ""
"Poruke o nedostajućim obveznim poljima mogu se pojaviti i nakon uspješnog "
"uvoza ako predložak ne sadrži sva polja koja ste u Galetteu označili kao "
"obvezna."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:284
msgid "Links between members"
msgstr "Povezivanje članova"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:288
msgid "You can link several members to a \"parent\" one. This may be used to store families for exemple, or members of a same company. You can access children members from the parent, and parent from the children."
msgstr ""
"Više članova možete povezati s jednim „nadređenim” članom. To je korisno, "
"primjerice, za obitelji ili članove iste tvrtke. Iz kartona nadređenog "
"možete otvoriti podređene članove, i obratno."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:290
msgid "You can add as many child as you want for a member, but a child cannot become a parent."
msgstr ""
"Član može imati neograničen broj podređenih članova, ali podređeni član ne "
"može postati nadređeni."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:292
msgid "The other interesting point of this system is you can retrieve some information from the parent when sending mailings or labels. In the children members, email and postal addresses automatically become optional, whatever the configuration says. If any of those information is missing, it will be retrieved from the parent."
msgstr ""
"Pri slanju skupnih poruka ili ispisu adresnih naljepnica mogu se preuzeti "
"podaci nadređenog člana. Kod podređenih članova adresa e-pošte i poštanska "
"adresa automatski postaju neobvezne bez obzira na postavke. Ako nedostaju, "
"preuzimaju se od nadređenog člana."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:294
msgid "Members without email adresses cannot use the \"retrieve password\" feature. This does not affect the uniqueness email constraint in the database."
msgstr ""
"Članovi bez adrese e-pošte ne mogu koristiti oporavak lozinke. To ne utječe "
"na ograničenje jedinstvenosti adresa e-pošte u bazi."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:299
msgid "Resetting a second factor"
msgstr "Poništavanje drugog faktora"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:303
msgid "A member who lost the device computing their codes, and has no :ref:`recovery code <man_2fa>` left either, cannot log in anymore. From the member page, administrators and staff members can reset their second factor: the secret and the remaining recovery codes are dropped, and the member logs in with their password alone until they enrol again."
msgstr ""
"Član koji izgubi uređaj za izračun kodova i nema preostalih :ref:`kodova za "
"oporavak <man_2fa>` više se ne može prijaviti. Administratori i članovi "
"uprave mogu poništiti njegov drugi faktor sa stranice člana: brišu se tajni "
"ključ i preostali kodovi za oporavak. Član se tada prijavljuje samo lozinkom "
"dok ponovno ne postavi drugi faktor."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:305
msgid "A reset only ever goes downwards. Your own second factor is not reset from here -- use your own page, which asks for a code first, so that a session somebody else found open cannot remove it. A staff member cannot reset an administrator's, and an administrator cannot reset another administrator's: only the super administrator can."
msgstr ""
"Drugi faktor može se poništiti samo korisnicima niže razine ovlasti. "
"Vlastiti faktor ne poništavate ovdje, nego na svojoj stranici, gdje se prvo "
"traži kod kako ga netko tko naiđe na otvorenu sesiju ne bi mogao ukloniti. "
"Član uprave ne može poništiti faktor administratora, a administrator ne može "
"poništiti faktor drugog administratora; to može samo glavni administrator."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:309
msgid "Do check who is asking. Resetting a second factor removes a protection, and a phone call claiming to be a member is exactly how somebody would go about getting one removed. The reset is recorded in the history, with who did it and for whom."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite identitet osobe koja traži poništavanje. Time se uklanja zaštita, "
"a telefonski poziv osobe koja se predstavlja kao član upravo je način na "
"koji bi je netko pokušao ukloniti. Poništavanje se bilježi u povijesti, "
"zajedno s podacima tko ga je izvršio i za koga."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:312
msgid "Impersonating"
msgstr "Prijava kao drugi korisnik"

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:316
msgid "Some issues may be related to a particular account, because of its ACLs, groups, ... In this case, it is unfortunately frequent to see some credentials sent by insecure emails; which should really be avoid."
msgstr ""
"Pojedini problemi mogu ovisiti o računu, njegovim ovlastima, grupama i "
"slično. U takvim se slučajevima, nažalost, često šalju pristupni podaci "
"nezaštićenom e-poštom, što treba izbjegavati."

#: ../usermanual/adherents.rst:318
msgid "As super administrator user, you will see an extra icon in the members list, allowing you to log in as selected user without his credentials. Once you've impersonated the user, you can reproduce the issue and fix it or get all required information to report the issue upstream."
msgstr ""
"Glavni administrator u popisu članova vidi dodatnu ikonu za prijavu kao "
"odabrani korisnik bez njegovih pristupnih podataka. Nakon prijave može "
"reproducirati problem i riješiti ga ili prikupiti podatke potrebne za "
"prijavu razvojnom timu."
